window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Past and present weave together in Donovan's point of view for the next chapter in Donovan and Sabrina's life.</i></b></p> <p>She was supposed to save me.</p> <p>In a twist of fate, I rescued her. Since then, I've lived for her, breathed for her, overreached with my love.</p> <p>She's still here, so I must be doing something right. But now I want more.</p> <p>Except, a dangerous secret from my past threatens to come between us, forcing me to confront what kind of man I am.</p> <p>And whether I'm the one who can save our future.</p> <p>Or whether fate has other plans for us.</p> <p>This book should be listened to after the Dirty Duet (<i>Dirty Filthy Rich Men</i> and <i>Dirty Filthy Rich Love</i>). It's not necessary to hear all the other books in the Dirty Universe before listening to this, but it is recommended for a better experience.</p>"; 
